# Source cameras for the 1080p/2x2 mosaic. One RTSP URL per line, row-major:
#   1 2
#   3 4
#
# Exactly 4 non-comment lines required. Use the "Low" quality RTSP alias
# from UniFi Protect (Camera -> Settings -> RTSP) for each camera.
#
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/wxyz1111
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/wxyz2222
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/wxyz3333
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/wxyz4444
